 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "A card is [suit, rank]; suits order CLUBS<DIAMONDS<HEARTS<SPADES, ranks A<2<...<10<J<Q<K. Shuffling is injected: the argument is the already shuffled 52-card deck. Cards are dealt one at a time round-robin from the top (card i goes to player i mod players). Generalised to 1..52 players: each receives floor(52/players) cards round-robin; the remaining cards stay undealt. Return the sorted hands.",
